@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' purpose: cut the wall-clock of `mise run build all` / `mise run deploy all`
'          where it actually is — minutes, not the byte column the size plan owns
' covers: cmd/proveo/maintain_cmd.go
' covers: internal/maintain/**
' covers: defs/lib/docker-build.sh
' covers: defs/**/Dockerfile
' covers: mise.toml
' session: 5906989d-2e00-4d61-bad8-4cc71a2bc244
' PLANNED. _spec/_plans/ is exempt from the SPEC-reference rule.
' sibling (bytes, not minutes) ... _spec/_plans/image-size-reduction.puml
' standing pipeline ............... _spec/internal/maintain/image-build-deploy.puml
' which buildx driver, FROM where  _spec/_devops/buildx-driver-selection.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' ── WHY THIS FILE EXISTS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
' `_spec/_plans/image-size-reduction.puml` ranked cuts by `docker image ls` /
' `docker history` / `docker system df -v`. Those instruments do not produce
' minutes. An operator watching `mise run build all` for ~an hour is asking a
' different question, and answering it from the size table is how a 29-minute
' local load gets blamed on Playwright's megabytes.
'
' ── WHAT THE HOST cmd TAB ACTUALLY SHOWED (2026-09-21, 23:09 PDT) ─────────
' Zellij session `sandbox`, tab `cmd`, cwd ~/Projects/proveo/sandbox,
' branch revision/tools, host linux/amd64 (protoss-twilight-council).
'
' MEASURED:
'   1. Images were tagged `:local` and `--load`ed. That is BuildPlan, not
'      DeployPlan (`:latest` + `buildx --push`). Last image written:
'      `docker.io/proveo/mitmproxy:local` (export + unpack, 0.3s). That is the
'      last name in Registry order, so this was `proveo build all`, complete.
'   2. Starship on the prompt after that export: **29m**. Sitting at a shell,
'      conda `(base)`, not inside a RUN.
'   3. Mid-run samples, not a full table:
'        cursor  stage-1 COPY git-sync / entrypoint, then `exporting layers`
'        opencode `#8` apt (ubuntu resolute) DONE 9.1–12.3s, then
'                 `#10 [6/18] npm install -g opencode-ai@1.18.32` (not CACHED)
'   4. A floating Zellij confirm sat on the same tab:
'        `Waiting to run: mise run deploy`  (Enter to run, Esc to drop).
'      It was NOT executing. DeployPlan is a second, multi-arch rebuild
'      (see cut 1). Mixing that overlay with the 29m load is how "~an hour"
'      appears without any one RUN holding a clock for 60 minutes.
'
' NOT MEASURED (and the first cut exists to close this):
'   per-target elapsed. The pane held ~5–6k lines of buildx TUI; this plan
'   does not invent a table from three samples. Until `proveo build` prints
'   `building <name>` + wall time, ranking below stays architectural, with
'   the samples as corroboration rather than a budget.
'
' ── THE FLEET `all` WALKS TODAY (16 TARGETS, WAS 14) ──────────────────────
' Registry() in internal/maintain/maintain.go, then
' `for _, t := range ts` in cmd/proveo/maintain_cmd.go. One process, one
' buildx at a time, host-arch `--load` for build, dual-arch `--push` for
' deploy. Size plan's 14/14 is stale: codex + codex-browser joined.
'
'   kind      name
'   base      base, base-node, base-node-lsp, base-node-browser
'   harness   cecli,
'             claudecode, claudecode-browser, claudecode-solidity,
'             codex, codex-browser,
'             cursor, cursor-browser,
'             opencode, opencode-browser
'   sidecar   egress-proxy, mitmproxy
'
' Bases must stay ordered (FROM chain). Harnesses after base-node-lsp /
' base-node-browser are independent of each other. Sidecars are independent
' of harnesses (egress-proxy COPY cmd/ + internal/, mitmproxy FROM upstream).
'
' ── DeployPlan IS NOT "PUSH THE :local WE JUST BUILT" ─────────────────────
' MEASURED from source (internal/maintain/maintain.go, TestDeployAndTestPlan):
'
'   docker image inspect <image>:local          # require the tested build
'   docker tag      <image>:local <image>:<tag> # local alias only
'   bash build.sh … --tag <tag> --push          # FULL rebuild, two platforms
'
' docker-build.sh: `--load` narrows PROVEO_PLATFORMS to the host; `--push`
' keeps linux/amd64,linux/arm64 and switches to the docker-container driver
' (`proveo-multiarch`), whose FROM store is the registry, not the daemon
' the :local tag just landed in. The tag step cannot skip that rebuild.
' A maintainer who runs `build all` then confirms `deploy` pays 29m + a
' QEMU/cross 16-target push. That pair is the hour. buildx-driver-selection
' already owns why the drivers differ; this file owns the wall-clock.
'
' ── VARIANT INVERSION: SIZE-NEGATIVE, TIME-POSITIVE ───────────────────────
' image-size-reduction deferred inversion because the browser payload stored
' once (~1.3 GB) would be stored per harness. That verdict is about the
' registry and `docker system df`. Wall-clock is the opposite: each
' `-browser` / `-solidity` is a second FROM a different base, so
' `npm install -g opencode-ai@…` / cursor `curl | bash` / claude plugin
' seed run again. Live cmd showed the opencode npm step uncached on the
' plain image; the browser variant will pay it a second time if that layer
' is not shared. Do not "fix" minutes by silently reversing the size
' verdict — name inversion here as a TIME cut with an explicit size budget.
'
' ── NO BuildKit CACHE MOUNTS ──────────────────────────────────────────────
' Grep of defs/**/Dockerfile at plan-open: zero `RUN --mount=type=cache`.
' Pin bumps (OPENCODE_VERSION, CLAUDE_CODE_VERSION, cecli-dev, playwright,
' cursor-agent) then pay full apt/npm/pip/go on a busted layer. Layer cache
' still helps a no-op rebuild; it does not help the step the operator is
' staring at (opencode `#10` was that step on 2026-09-21).
'
' ── OTHER TIME TAXES, RANKED UNDER THE TWO ABOVE ──────────────────────────
' COPY cmd/ + internal/ into proveo/base (entrypoint builder) and
'   proveo/egress-proxy — any Go change busts both, then every FROM base.
' `go install github.com/isaacphi/mcp-language-server@latest` and
'   `go install golang.org/x/tools/gopls@latest` in cursor and codex
'   lsp-builder stages — unpinned, cache-hostile (agent-version-pin.puml
'   already forbids this shape for the *agent* binary).
' playwright install --with-deps --no-shell chromium on base-node-browser
'   (size plan cut 13 is the byte half; this is the apt clock).
' cecli: two pip venvs (cecli-dev, serena-agent).
' claudecode: `claude plugin marketplace add` + per-plugin install seed.
' cursor: curl | bash against cursor.com/install, once per cursor image.
' proveo-harden: find(1) after many RUNs — CPU, not network.
' Cold Hub / builder DNS: load mode may retry `--pull=false`
'   (docker-build.sh); push mode may not. This sandbox's own `build all`
'   died SIGTERM mid-pull of golang:1.26-trixie — a different host, same
'   tax when the resolver misses.
'
' ── CUTS (DO NOT START AT 6) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
' 1  Instrument elapsed. `ui.Appf("building %s")` already fires per
'    target; persist start/end + fail the run summary without a duration.
'    Closes the "NOT MEASURED" hole. Cheap. Do this first.
' 2  Stop paying deploy as a second compile of the same tree. Options,
'    pick with a test not a preference:
'      a. `buildx build --push` with `--cache-from` the :local image /
'         a named cache exporter, so the dual-arch push reuses layers
'         the load just produced where platforms overlap.
'      b. native-arch `--push` of the loaded image + a documented
'         second job for the foreign arch (breaks "every published
'         tag is a two-arch list" — only if image-lineage agrees).
'      c. leave DeployPlan, but refuse `deploy all` while `build all`
'         is the command the operator thinks they ran (the confirm
'         overlay on cmd is this foot-gun in the flesh).
' 3  Parallelise after the base chain. Bases stay serial. Harnesses
'    with disjoint FROM parents may run together; sidecar pair too.
'    Keep Registry order as the *dependency* order, not the *execute*
'    order. The loop in maintain_cmd.go is the one line.
' 4  `RUN --mount=type=cache` on apt lists, npm cache, Go module
'    cache, pip cache. Does not shrink the image (size plan's job).
'    Does shrink pin-bump and --no-cache minutes.
' 5  Pin the lsp-builder `go install` versions the way
'    proveo_agent_version pins the agent. @latest is a clock.
' 6  Re-open inversion as a TIME cut: `FROM proveo/<harness>` +
'    browser layer, with the size plan's +GB called out as the cost.
'    Not next, and not free. Cursor still has no node at build time
'    (size plan, note on CURSOR).
'
' ── VERIFICATION (when a cut lands, not before) ───────────────────────────
'   internal/maintain: DeployPlan still lists inspect + tag + rebuild
'     until cut 2 changes that list (TestDeployAndTestPlan).
'   cmd/proveo: `build all` no longer a single for-loop once cut 3
'     lands — a test that the plan *print* contains concurrent groups
'     after bases, never before.
'   defs: a contract grep for `--mount=type=cache` once cut 4 lands
'     (today the absence is the test: dockerfile_correctness can pin
'     "zero cache mounts" until then, so the cut fails it on purpose).
'   Timed `mise run build all` on this host, same cold/warm conditions,
'     reported next to the 29m baseline. No estimated minutes in this
'     file pretending to be that number.
'
title PLANNED — wall-clock of build all / deploy all\n29m local load measured; the hour is the pair

node "Maintainer host (linux/amd64)" as HOST <<host>> {
  component "mise run build all\nBuildPlan → :local --load" as BUILD <<app>>
  component "for _, t := range ts\n16 targets, one buildx" as SEQ <<app>>
  component "mise run deploy all\nDeployPlan → --push amd64+arm64" as DEPLOY <<app>>
}

folder "Registry order — 16 names" as REG <<host>> {
  component "4 bases\nserial FROM chain" as BASES <<app>>
  component "10 harnesses\nindependent after bases" as HAR <<app>>
  component "2 sidecars\negress-proxy · mitmproxy" as SIDE <<app>>
}

folder "paid twice on a variant" as DUP <<host>> {
  component "npm / pip / curl|bash\nagent install per FROM" as AGT <<error>>
  component "playwright --with-deps\nonce on the browser base" as PW <<app>>
}

cloud "Hub + npm + PyPI + cursor.com" as NET <<cloud>>
component "docker-container driver\nFROM the registry, not :local" as DCONT <<error>>
component "no RUN --mount=type=cache" as NOCACHE <<error>>
component "**29m** starship\nmitmproxy:local last" as M29 <<app>>
component "**~hour** if Enter\non the deploy overlay" as HOUR <<error>>

BUILD ARROW_MAIN SEQ
SEQ ARROW_MAIN BASES
BASES ARROW_MAIN HAR
HAR ARROW_MAIN SIDE
SIDE ARROW_MAIN M29 : load finished
M29 ARROW_ERROR HOUR : overlay waiting
HOUR ARROW_MAIN DEPLOY
DEPLOY ARROW_ERROR DCONT : rebuild, not push :local
HAR ARROW_ERROR AGT : each -browser / -solidity
BASES ARROW_MAIN PW
SEQ ARROW_CLOUD NET
NOCACHE ARROW_ERROR SEQ : pin bump pays full fetch

note bottom of BUILD
  **Measured, 2026-09-21 23:09 PDT.**
  cmd tab, "":local"" --load, last image
  proveo/mitmproxy:local, prompt 29m.
  Size-plan 14/14 is stale: 16 names.
end note

note right of DEPLOY
  **Inspect + tag + rebuild.**
  TestDeployAndTestPlan pins this.
  Dual-arch --push uses a different
  driver than the load that just
  finished, so :local is invisible.
end note

note bottom of SEQ
  **Bases serial, the rest need not
  be.** The for-loop is the clock.
  Print elapsed per name before
  touching anything else (cut 1).
end note

note bottom of AGT
  **Inversion is time-positive.**
  The size plan rejected it on
  registry bytes. Reopen it here
  only with that +GB named (cut 6).
end note

note right of NOCACHE
  **Zero cache mounts today.**
  Layer cache helps a no-op.
  The live opencode npm step
  was not CACHED. Mounts cut
  the next pin bump, not this.
end note

note bottom of HOUR
  **Do not confirm deploy from
  muscle memory after build all.**
  That overlay is how 29m becomes
  an hour without a stuck RUN.
end note

@enduml
